            "title": "عبارة vₙ",
            "explanation": "بما أن \\(v_0=-2\\) والأساس \\(\\frac23\\):\n\\[v_n=v_0\\left(\\frac23\\right)^n=-2\\left(\\frac23\\right)^n.\\]",
